==Requirements==
Player must complete [[Quest:Robot Woes]] in order to do [[Quest:The Legendary Sunstone]]
==To Start==
Speak with [[Rizzle]] located in [[Whirly's Scrap Camp]] in [[Sunstone Valley]].
==Goals==
Rizzle has pointed you at a strange dwarf in search of the "Legendary Sunstone" in Sunstone Valley.
*Find Noggle Cogloose
==Steps==
#Speak with [[Rizzle]] located in [[Whirly's Scrap Camp]] in [[Sunstone Valley]].
#*"Wait, I know! I’ll give you information!<br />Yes, this is really valuable. See, there’s this crazy dwarf with a whole bunch of junk, but he won’t let anyone touch it unless they help him find some “Legendary Sunstone.” <font color='#D9781A'>Help the dwarf</font> and you could be rich!" -Rizzle
#Speak with [[Noggle Cogloose]] located in [[Noggle's Retreat]], [[Sunstone Valley]].
#*"You there, yes you with the face!<br />You heard the news then? About my Power Crystals? Oh but of course you did! Who hasn’t really? That’s a much better question.<br />Well, what are you going to do about it?" -Noggle Cogloose
